# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
*.egg
dist/
build/
*.whl

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Testing
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Forge cached data
*.pkl
*.parquet

# Congressional corpus: the archives under data/congressional_archive/Store/
# are the committed copy. Extracting them here is expected and useful, but the
# ~35,000 loose files are byte-identical to the archives and must not be
# committed again — the parser reads the archives directly.
data/congressional_archive/BILLSTATUS-*.xml

# Learning-algorithm scratch. +la/main.m and the optimizers write dated run
# artifacts here; they are experiment output, not inputs to any pipeline.
+la/temp/

# Trained TF-IDF classifier. Deliberately not committed: it is a 4.4 MB pickle,
# scikit-learn pickles do not load reliably across versions, and `forge classify`
# rebuilds it from the committed corpus in about 40 seconds. Run that once after
# cloning; without it the pipeline warns and falls back to the legacy classifier.
+la/tfidf_classifier.pkl

# Generated pipeline outputs. These are produced by `forge run` and are not
# inputs to anything, so they are regenerated rather than committed.
#
# The CSVs under data/{STATE}/outputs/ and data/{STATE}/elo_model/ are NOT
# ignored: they are the MATLAB results of record, and the only reference the
# Python port can be validated against. Only the binary .mat companions and the
# large Monte Carlo dumps are excluded.
data/*/prediction_model/*.mat
data/*/elo_model/**/*.mat
data/*/merged_data/
data/*/merged_data.zip

# The reproducible baseline (scripts/regenerate_baseline.sh). Unlike the MATLAB
# outputs above it regenerates deterministically from committed inputs in about
# fifteen minutes, so the ~100 MB of CSVs is not worth carrying in the history —
# being reproducible is the whole point of it. The README explaining what it is
# and how to rebuild it is committed.
baseline/*
!baseline/README.md
